  "limitations": [
    "已由真实 LX6 客体读取 G39 并通过 RMT27 更新单颗 GRB；未继承 Atom Lite 的原厂镜像验收。SPM1423 PDM、红外、物理 USB、Grove 外设与无线尚未实现。",
    "Manufacturer photos retain their original rights; exterior dimensions are source-backed while local feature sizes and materials are approximate.",
    "Hidden populated PCB, internal fasteners and material calibration remain unknown. PCB placeholder is explicitly marked UNKNOWN.",
    "Source images never cover the simulated display with a static firmware screenshot.",
    "Connector shape/position estimates do not establish pin1 mating, electrical routing or working cables.",
    "原色、金色和透明材质需要浏览器复核；本批静态检查不代表1:1照片或实物通过。",
    "Current official table says53×20×10.3mm, while the product graphic says52×20×10mm. Nominal53 is used and discrepancy remains; USB-A hidden construction/pin mating is approximate, not a connector standard CAD.",
    "M5 front relief traces this SKU official dimensional drawing; 0.1mm depth, connector wall thickness and lock-window sizes remain estimates, not native CAD or physical fit acceptance."
  ],
